      "text": "Graph:                Adjacency LIST          Adjacency MATRIX\n                           (array of lists)         (V x V bit/weight)\n       0 ---> 1                                         to: 0 1 2 3\n       |    / |             0 -> [1, 2]              from 0 [0 1 1 0]\n       v   /  v             1 -> [3]                      1 [0 0 0 1]\n       2 <-   3             2 -> []                       2 [0 0 0 0]\n                            3 -> [2]                      3 [0 0 1 0]"
